# EMC chemistry file: liquid n-butane reference system for PCFF (LAMMPS vs OpenMM).
#
# Prepare (from this directory):
#   emc.pl input.esh                              -> build.emc, butane.in
#   emc_linux_x86_64 build.emc 2>&1 | tee build.out  -> butane.data, butane.params, butane.pdb, butane.psf
#
# Notes:
# - Columns are separated by tabs; the EMC manual (Sec. 4.5.2) allows only tabs or commas.
# - No field_location: EMC uses its own PCFF files (EMC_ROOT/field/cff/pcff, the default field location).
# - ntotal 1400 = 100 molecules x 14 atoms (C4H10).
# - density 0.5 g/cc with 100 molecules gives a cubic box of about 26.8 Angstrom, larger than 2 x 9.5 Angstrom cutoff.
# - Cutoffs, Ewald, and kspace precision are left at emc.pl PCFF defaults (pair 9.5, charge 9.5, pppm/cg 0.001).

ITEM	OPTIONS

project	butane
seed	2026

replace	true
build_dir	.
field	pcff
field_id	pcff
density	0.5
ntotal	1400

ITEM	END

ITEM	GROUPS

butane	CCCC

ITEM	END

ITEM	CLUSTERS

butane	butane	1

ITEM	END
